sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cust as Customer
    participant Orders as orders module
    participant Fx as FxService
    participant DB as Postgres

    Cust->>Orders: create order (currency=RUB)
    Orders->>Fx: snapshot(base=USD, quote=RUB)
    Fx->>DB: SELECT fx_snapshots WHERE base, quote ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1
    alt recent snapshot (< 5 min)
        DB-->>Fx: existing FxSnapshot
        Fx-->>Orders: reused snapshot
    else stale / missing
        Fx->>Fx: get_rate(USD, RUB)  -- through cache+chain
        Fx->>DB: INSERT fx_snapshots(...)
        DB-->>Fx: new FxSnapshot
        Fx-->>Orders: new snapshot
    end
    Orders->>DB: INSERT orders(..., fx_snapshot_id=snap.id, total_charged=usd*rate)
    Orders-->>Cust: 201 order
```
